          "text_sha256": "5e2575099434010684e7887766f9878e31c31ff528dba5133e512cf15746eb80",
          "value": {
            "id": "97-S1",
            "title": "湘云线的核心不是“丈夫不归”，而是“缺席如何变成家务事实”"
          }
        },
        "chapter_card_fields": [
          {
            "citation": {
              "byte_range": [
                43034,
                43195
              ],
              "lines": [
                1086,
                1088
              ],
              "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
              "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
              "text_sha256": "51e0f8952a21bb0a8094a1fcaba0d209642709bf4ef8e896ccf40002c09f9f27"
            },
            "name": "硬节点",
            "number": 1,
            "text": "**1｜硬节点**  \nR34湘云/若兰关联但O06终局开放；R41妙玉“欲洁未洁、终陷淖泥”方向，瓜州具体遭遇不锁；R33惜春为尼。\n\n"
          },
          {
            "citation": {
              "byte_range": [
                44259,
                44372
              ],
              "lines": [
                1106,
                1108
              ],
              "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
              "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
              "text_sha256": "0045c275f11629e1d3f0e544127a45f38796d5890cd5ff5df3c51fad60ebb210"
            },
            "name": "诗文身份",
            "number": 7,
            "text": "**7｜诗文身份**  \n湘云无完整新诗；妙玉无偈；惜春无偈/终极画跋。实用书写即足。\n\n"
          },
          {
            "citation": {
              "byte_range": [
                44481,
                44664
              ],
              "lines": [
                1112,
                1114
              ],
              "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
              "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
              "text_sha256": "400c9af47afb8926552ec4466ca0f9fa863bc4d6788b2b2a86b3e8aa09db4183"
            },
            "name": "宗教/梦",
            "number": 9,
            "text": "**9｜宗教/梦**  \n41最高重点：妙玉=洁与尘，不“终于悟”；惜春=断与冷，不“件件想明白”。湘云门栓错听只作梦阈，不升级若兰托梦。\n\n"
          },
          {
            "citation": {
              "byte_range": [
                45080,
                45197
              ],
              "lines": [
                1124,
                1126
              ],
              "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
              "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
              "text_sha256": "de902b88f3f91947d35faf70b46c31da966dbde1a065d9f108f2f060d2a27c09"
            },
            "name": "应删",
            "number": 13,
            "text": "**13｜应删**  \n“三人都看破了”的作者句；妙玉佛偈；惜春悟道宣言；湘云望夫诗/梦。\n\n"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "97-S1-F2",
      "description": "不得以“已经看破”替代房租、瓦钱、份饭；不得把金麒麟的实际来路补造为确定物流。",
      "status": "PENDING",
      "scope": "AUTHORING_REQUIREMENT_NOT_HISTORICAL_FACT",
